+#### Finish bag
+
+A "Finish bag" text button under the roast line on the coffee page, shown only while the bag is open. The first tap
+changes it to "Tap again to finish it", and the second tap saves. Finishing writes a new bag record with today's date
+in `finished_on`, through the outbox like any write; nothing is deleted. The page reloads with "Bag finished: Onyx
+Geometry". The bag leaves Today, Switch coffee and Log shot. Coffees keeps it, marked "finished". If no open bag is
+left, Today says nothing is on the grinder and offers a new bag. Edit bag's "Still using it" reopens it.
+
